# Generated deployment credentials (see docs/operations.md) must never enter the build context.
/nexus.env
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The image builds from a clean tree: the package manifests, tsconfig.base.json,
# contracts/ and the shared/, server/ and web/ workspaces. Local installs, build
# output and databases must not leak into it: tsc deletes nothing, so a stale
# file in a local server/dist would survive into the runtime stage.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-server
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Not part of the build.
.github
.agents
.claude
ci
docs
e2e
release
*.md
